# TMDB Next.js Frontend - Cline Rules

## 🧪 Testing

### Component Tests
- **Framework**: Cypress Component Testing
- **Location**: `tests/cypress/component/components/*.cy.js`
- **Library**: `@testing-library/cypress`
- **Mount**: `cy.mount(<Component />)`
- **Queries**: `cy.findByRole()`, `cy.findByText()`, `cy.getByTestId()`
- **Assertions**: `.should('exist')`, `.should('be.visible')`, `.should('have.focus')`
- **Events**: `.click()`, `cy.realPress()` für Keyboard

### Unit Tests
- **Framework**: Vitest
- **Location**: `tests/vitest/utils/*.test.js`, `tests/vitest/services/*.test.js`
- **Library**: `@testing-library/react` + `vitest`

### Acceptance Tests (E2E)
- **Framework**: Cypress E2E
- **Location**: `tests/cypress/acceptance/flows/*.cy.js`
- **Focus**: User Flows über mehrere Pages

## 📁 Project Structure

```
components/        # React Komponenten (*.jsx)
styles/           # SCSS Dateien
public/           # Static assets
tests/
  ├── cypress/
  │   ├── component/   # Component Tests
  │   └── acceptance/  # E2E Tests
  └── vitest/        # Unit Tests
```

## 💻 Code Style

- **React**: Funktionale Komponenten mit Hooks
- **Imports**: Absolute Pfade (`@/components/...`)
- **Exports**: Benannte Exports (`export { Component }`)
- **No TypeScript**: Reines JavaScript (.jsx)

## 🎯 Component Test Beispiel

```js
import { Component } from '@/components/Component';

describe('Component', () => {
  it('renders correctly', () => {
    cy.mount(<Component prop="value" />);
    cy.findByRole('button').should('exist');
  });
});
```

## ⚙️ Cline Settings

- **max_context_tokens**: 100000
- **auto_load_files**: true
- **Model**: Qwen3 (lokal auf M1 Mac)
